  era: "c. 1216\u20131311 \xB7 Section 13 \xB7 South Indian Kingdoms \xB7 c. 850 \u2013 1650 CE"
  title: The later Pandyas
  text: The Pandyas revived in the 13th century and briefly dominated the south; Marco Polo visited their coast. Malik Kafur's raid in 1311 and civil wars weakened them, and the short-lived Madurai Sultanate followed.
